> What does this part do?
> 
> ```js
> if (opts.destroyOnReturn || state.autoDestroy) {
>         destroyImpl.destroyer(stream, err);
> }
> ```

@daukadolt It destroys the stream if either the [`destroyOnReturn`](https://nodejs.org/api/stream.html#stream_readable_iterator_options) option or the [`autoDestroy`](https://nodejs.org/api/stream.html#stream_new_stream_writable_options) option have been passed.

